{"negative":{"rating":1,"review":"I usually buy a different contact solution but I was reading the  reviews of it on Walmart.com and they recommended opti-free brand pure moist. I figured I would try it but somehow I ended up with this product instead. I decided to try it since I was out of contact solution and needed something to use. Upon beginning to use it, my eyes were red and irritated. Now it feels like there is something growing on my inner eyelid and my eye hurts. Now I can't wear my contacts because I need to let my eyes heal. Save your money and don't go with this product, unless you've used it in the past and it has worked for you."},"positive":{"rating":4,"review":"Great contact solution and a really great price.  
This actually was one of the 3 my eye doctor suggested has being a good cleaning and storage solution.  

I would highly recommend myself.  Doesn't burn and cleans contacts very well."}}

{"negative":{"rating":2,"review":"Feels lovely to apply and sits so comfortably on the lips. Unfortunately the shade I selected (Seditious) bears absolutely no resemblance whatsoever to the pictures of models wearing this shade on the website. I have a medium dark complexion - sadly the lipstick gave me the appearance of a corpse and the refill went straight in the bin. Given the price tag, I was fairly disappointed about this. Also a shame, as the case is very chic and slick. Great at least that refills can be removed and replaced."},"positive":{"rating":5,"review":"Love this lipstick! I got the shades Unauthorized, Rendez-Vous and Liason. 

It applies like a dream! So smooth and creamy and very pigmented. It feels really hydrating on the lips, similar to a lip balm and the satin feel is so comforting. 

It does last a long time but, in my opinion, is not very smudge resistant so it fades when you eat/drink."}}

{"negative":{"rating":1,"review":"Seller sent incorrect item, causing a delay in making a recipe I bought perishable ingredients for.  They sent some off brand Coconut Oil, not the Nutiva Coconut Manna I ordered.  The photo on my order clearly shows Nutiva Coconut Manna."},"positive":{"rating":5,"review":"Nutiva Organic Virgin Coconut Oil is hands down one of the best coconut oils I have ever tried. The quality is exceptional—pure, organic, and cold-pressed, ensuring all the nutrients and natural flavor are retained. The taste is rich yet subtle, making it versatile for both cooking and personal care.

I use this oil regularly for sautéing vegetables, baking, and even in my coffee as a healthier alternative to creamer. It's also a staple in my beauty routine for moisturizing my skin and hair. The texture is smooth, and it melts effortlessly without leaving any residue.

The 14 fl oz jar is the perfect size for regular use, and the airtight packaging keeps it fresh for a long time. It's great to know this product is ethically sourced and free of harmful chemicals. If you're looking for a high-quality coconut oil, Nutiva is a fantastic choice."}}

{"negative":{"rating":1,"review":"I loved the advertised features; however, it took less than 5 mins for the 5ft pole and its features to fail.  Like the 14ft Fiskar Pole I had purchased earlier, that failed to 'open and close' to complete a cut, the 5ft Cutter also failed to close and open to complete a cut.  The both stayed open.  

Do you have and idea or can I get a referral...?  I think the both have 'life-time' warranties. I am not ready to through either of them away; I loved the operational features.

I do not have boxes long enough to ship them in."},"positive":{"rating":5,"review":"I'm 68 with health issues. You don't have to have a great deal of strength to use this one. We have another pruner that is so heavy for me to handle, extended or not. I trimmed the pear tree we inherited, and this Fiskar did a great job. I'd recommend this tool to anyone but especially my senior Ladies who still want to work in their yards. My son-in-law is jealous that the head can be angled! 5 out of 5 all day long!"}}

{"negative":{"rating":2,"review":"The quality of this green tea is subpar. The color of the tea is brownish green and not the bright green matcha quality as I was expecting. Would not buy this again."},"positive":{"rating":5,"review":"Most teas-even those that are certified as fair trade-come from large plantations where workers have little say and are trapped in a system of dependency. Together, we are building a different tea model, one that gives small-scale farmers greater access to the market, affording them more economic power, better lives, and healthier communities. 

We are proud to support the small- scale farmers of the Potong Tea Garden in Darjeeling, India, an organic, fair trade tea garden managed by Tea Promoters of India (TPI). TPI is a pioneer in environmental and social reform in the tea industry. Once a colonial plantation, the Potong Tea Garden is now collectively run by its workers and is paving a stronger, more democratic path forward for the community.

This delicate green tea is a great choice to start your day or brighten your afternoon. Sip it and feel renewed. good quality tea giving good health benefits. "}}

{"negative":{"rating":1,"review":"This isn't the drivers fault unless he/she pulled the items, but I ordered this crystal light lemonade singles in the pack of 3 because my sister who had a stroke and can barely move from her chair loves these.  One box of that sent was fine, but the other two was actually energy boost classic lemonade with 75mg of caffeine.  I received and order before this one of the crystal light lemonade before that was wrong and didn't complain but this is just to much."},"positive":{"rating":5,"review":"Crystal Light Lemonade is a lifesaver for anyone looking to cut back on sugar but still enjoy a refreshing, flavorful drink. These single-serve packets are incredibly convenient—just pour one into a bottle of water, shake, and you're good to go. The lemonade flavor is bright and citrusy, with just the right balance of tartness and sweetness. It's surprisingly flavorful for being sugar-free and caffeine-free, with no bitter aftertaste that you sometimes get with diet drinks.

Each packet is small enough to toss in your purse, backpack, or lunchbox, making it perfect for travel, work, or staying hydrated throughout the day. If you struggle to drink enough water, this is an excellent way to make it more enjoyable without adding calories. The 10-count box lasts a while, and the price point is reasonable for the value.

Whether you're avoiding sugar, following a keto or low-carb diet, or just trying to drink more water, these packets offer a great-tasting solution. I've tried a few other flavors from Crystal Light, but lemonade is definitely a top-tier classic. Light, crisp, and convenient—these are a staple in my pantry."}}

