{"negative":{"rating":1,"review":"Ordered Bridgestone golf balls and sStryker balls were in the box!"},"positive":{"rating":5,"review":"Low spin off the tee but it has great feel and spin control within 100 when you need it.  

I am a fan of the double dimple and it feels soft without lacking durability. Unless you find the path you wont need to worry much about marking up your ball. 

Holds up against proV, tp5 but is cheaper."}}

{"negative":{"rating":1,"review":"We have only had this product for 2 weeks. I have copied their description -" Protective water repellent and resistant PVC undercoating. This Veranda Patio Chair Cover is an elegant way to safeguard your furniture. It features special treatments to ensure that the fabric won't crack in cold weather. This Veranda Patio Chair Cover makes it easy to keep your investment shielded against the elements."

The resistant undercoating did not do its job. We have a mold like substance under all the pieces we bought. The fabric has already faded and looks old. As for the fabric we already have cracks/splits in 3 out of the 4 pieces we purchased.

This is a terrible product and wouldn't recommend it to my worse enemy."},"positive":{"rating":5,"review":"We recently had snow, hail, and gale force winds.  The cover stayed put and sheltered my wooden bench without a hitch.  I love the velco tie downs which are so easy to apply and remove."}}

{"negative":{"rating":1,"review":"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] After only one use I noticed a lot of (pilling). So much so that I will not put them on my bed again as they are developing the texture of sandpaper so this is a toss or return item. Where all the great reviews came from I will never understand!"},"positive":{"rating":5,"review":"I am pleased with the softness and quality of these sheets. I was hesitant to purchase but the Mother's Day special code allowed me to give it a try!

I wish I would have gotten more but all the colors were sold out except for the gray. I'll be looking for more deals to get more! 

I wish the width would have been longer and that's the only thing I would have wanted different. It's still not a deal breaker though!"}}

{"negative":{"rating":1,"review":"One of the snacks that every child lives and eats is bioengineered product! Why? Why every second product in the grocery stores is trying to kill us nowadays. 

I don't recommend this product to anyone, especially for kids. Feed your children well if you want them to be healthy and well."},"positive":{"rating":5,"review":"These colorful little snacks are everything I didn't know I needed. Same classic cheesy Goldfish taste we all love — but make it rainbow! 🐟🌈

They're fun, kid-approved, and honestly… adult-approved too. Perfect for lunchboxes, road trips, or just eating by the handful while pretending you bought them “for the kids.” The bright colors make snack time feel more exciting without adding weird flavors — still that original cheddar goodness."}}

{"negative":{"rating":2,"review":"The composition of essential oils is a benefit, so is the size. But the scent is horrible, I wouldn't say it's safe for sensitive skin. Packaging is plastic, another negative quality. It does an okay job moisturizing and nourishing, but it's so heavy using it clogs skin. "},"positive":{"rating":5,"review":"The Aura Cacia Grapeseed Skin Care Oil is a versatile product that works great for moisturizing and nourishing the skin. It's a high-quality essential oil that feels light and absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue. The scent is mild, which makes it perfect for those who are sensitive to strong fragrances.

I find this oil especially beneficial for my sensitive skin, as it's gentle and soothing. The composition of the oil is simple yet effective, making it ideal for regular use. The packaging is practical and keeps the oil fresh. 

Overall, it's an excellent addition to any skincare routine, particularly if you're looking for something that's moisturizing, nourishing, and suitable for sensitive skin. I would highly recommend it for anyone who needs a gentle and hydrating oil."}}
